 "ruling": "REFUSED.  In2 is one of only THREE routable layers (F, B, In2) for every signal net on this board, and the pour takes it from all of them for 1-2 SYS edges.  It would repeat exactly the defect D-608 censused on In3: 111 tracks / 969.6 mm of legacy copper on a layer their own net may no longer route on.  The In2 SYS pour is a SCREEN, not a promotion."
}
